## THE 12 MODELS

Ranked by **Compound Score** = (Lindy × Vietnam-fit × Speed-to-cash × Cash ceiling × AI-resistance) / 5

### TIER A — Highest compound potential, $0 startup, Vietnam-local advantage

---

#### MODEL 1: Vietnam Trade Connector (Sourcing Agent)
**What:** Connect foreign buyers to specific VN manufacturers in ONE product category. Earn 3-8% finder fee.
**Example niche:** Robusta S16 → Singapore roasters, rattan furniture → US interior designers, lacquerware → EU home decor
**Startup:** $0 | **Time to first $:** 4-8 weeks | **P50:** $800-3K/mo | **P90:** $8K+/mo
**Lindy:** STRONG PASS — trade facilitation existed for centuries; 17 FTAs make it stronger [K] pwc.com Vietnam 2025
**Compound mechanism:** Each completed order → buyer trust → repeat orders + referrals. Network effect: supplier relationships compound.
**AI-resistance:** HIGH — trust, physical verification, relationship = human-only
**CCC:** 30-60 days (payment after shipment) | **Kill:** Can't ID 10 verified foreign buyers in 60 days
**Score: 8.4/10**

---

#### MODEL 2: ESG/CSRD Supply Chain Audit Service
**What:** EU CSRD mandates supply chain sustainability data from VN suppliers by 2026-2028. VN suppliers don't know how to provide it. You bridge the gap.
**Startup:** $0-50 (framework is public) | **Time to first $:** 4-8 weeks | **P50:** $4K/mo | **P90:** $10K+/mo
**Lindy:** STRONG — EU regulation mandatory, timeline extends to 2028+ for tier-2 suppliers [K] KPMG Vietnam 2026 outlook
**Compound mechanism:** Each audit → case study → referral. Expertise compounds. Template library = leverage.
**AI-resistance:** HIGH — requires physical factory visits, local language, relationship
**CCC:** 15-30 days (project-based) | **Kill:** PwC/Deloitte VN commoditizes at low cost within 12mo
**Score: 8.2/10**

