#### MODEL 3: Niche Vietnamese Supplier Directory (Data Asset)
**What:** Searchable database of verified VN suppliers in ONE category. Sell access to foreign buyers. TractorData model ($46K/mo, 25yr old, solo) applied to VN supply chain.
**Startup:** $10-50 | **Time to first $:** 3-6 months | **P50:** $800-2K/mo (yr1) | **P90:** $5K-25K/mo (yr2+)
**Lindy:** STRONGEST — TractorData 25yr, OnlineJobs.ph $10M+/yr, BuiltWith $14M ARR prove model [K] boringcashcow.com 2025
**Compound mechanism:** Each listing → more traffic → more buyers → more suppliers want listing. Two-sided network effect.
**AI-resistance:** HIGH — local verification of suppliers = human moat. Foreign buyer can't replicate from abroad.
**CCC:** Subscription = pre-paid | **Kill:** Google indexes competing free directory before 50 paying subscribers
**Score: 8.0/10**

