## RISK FACTORS

| Risk | Models Affected | Severity | Mitigation |
|------|----------------|----------|------------|
| AI commoditizes generic services | 7, 9 | HIGH | Specialize in compliance/regulated niches |
| Trust deficit with foreign buyers | 1, 2, 3, 4, 11 | MEDIUM | Portfolio/case studies, free sample report |
| Platform algorithm changes | 5, 6, 10 | MEDIUM | Own email list, direct relationships |
| VN government digitization kills data moat | 8 | LOW (no sign of unified portal) | Pivot to analysis layer |
| EU regulation timeline slips | 2 | LOW (already in force) | Expand to non-EU buyers |
| "Boring business" advice now mainstream | ALL | MEDIUM | Niche deeper than category level |

**[RISK:AI_DISRUPTION]** — Models 7 (technical writing) and 9 (research-as-subscription) face AI disruption for generic work. Survival requires specialization in regulated/compliance niches where AI output can't be legally relied upon.

**[RISK:CHANNEL_DECAY]** — Model 10 (browser tool) depends on Google SEO which faces AI Overviews disruption. Mitigate with direct traffic and Vietnamese-language search (less AI Overview penetration).

